Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.43-rt63 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.43 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: 45e06ca512045c1c7fb333f9db850c25f06cfd6b


Or to build 3.2.43-rt63 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.43.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.43-rt63.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve



